      "source_sha256": "c7ad9b676ffe0201c431e8ee3e016f8e5daf4239d835ba2aaf0854aae01f0a13",
      "target": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant WD as Working Directory\n    participant SA as Staging Area\n    participant LR as Local Repo\n    participant R as Remote (GitHub)\n    WD->>SA: git add\n    SA->>LR: git commit\n    LR->>R: git push\n    R->>LR: git fetch\n    LR->>WD: git pull\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-02:b0020",
