    {
      "segment_id": "00-02:b0049",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Git & Collaboration",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "a4d6ce0aea25ef46781f23d86fa59aac75f845de1c734d685f5b1abcf28e7aef",
      "target": "| 命令 | 使用场景 |\n|---------|------|\n| `git clone` | 获取课程仓库 |\n| `git add` + `git commit` | 保存工作成果 |\n| `git push` | 将工作成果备份到 GitHub |\n| `git checkout -b` | 尝试新想法，同时不影响 main |\n| `git log --oneline` | 查看已经完成的工作 |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-02:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
