      "target": "## 练习\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-02:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Git & Collaboration",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-02:b0055",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Git & Collaboration",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "f7601abe034f1741225b14678aa64b41e863e59ea46961b9d2429825547dfa0c",
      "target": "1. 为本仓库创建分叉，克隆你的分叉，创建名为 `my-progress` 的分支，新建一个文件，将它提交并推送\n2. 创建一个 `.gitignore`，排除模型检查点文件（`.pt`、`.pth`、`.safetensors`）\n3. 使用 `git log --oneline` 查看本仓库的提交历史，了解课程是如何逐步添加的\n"
    },
